      "number": "1.1",
      "title": "Structure of Committees",
      "body": "Committees of Buhurt International are structured vertically in 3 levels:\n●International: overseen by the Council ●Conference: overseen by Conference Head and Deputy Conference Head Head ●Regional: overseen by Regional Head",
