    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "depth": 2,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.2.1",
      "title": "International",
      "body": "●The Committees are led by a Council. The Council serves as the head of the Committees.\nIts members have decision-making authority and lead the Committees in its endeavors.\n\n●The Council is led by an International Head and a Deputy International Head.\n\n●The Council is responsible for organizing General Meetings for decision-making purposes and Council Meetings as needed.\n\n●The Council is tasked with sanctioning rules infractions.\n\n●The Council includes every Committee's members with the accreditation of Conference Head and Deputy Conference Head.",
