    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "depth": 2,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.2.4",
      "title": "Advisors",
      "body": "●The Committees can include Advisors. These individuals act as counselors, sharing their knowledge and expertise as experts in their respective fields.\n\n●While they are not formal members of the Committees and do not hold an accreditation, they are permitted to participate in discussions and contribute to the Committee's work.\n\n●Advisors are eligible to attend General Meetings but are not entitled to vote.\n\n●Advisors are designated by the Council of the committee.",
