    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "depth": 2,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "2.1.1",
      "title": "Trainees",
      "body": "●Trainees are individuals new to the Committee's missions, who are enthusiastic about participating and learning.\n\n●They are in a developmental phase and contribute to the work of the Committees.\n\n●They are eligible to participate in the General Meetings but do not possess voting rights.",
