      "body": "●Once trainees have sufficient experience, they can be rewarded by Regional accreditation.\n\n●They are now active members of the Committees and participate in the Committee’s mission.\n\n●They are eligible to participate in the General Meetings and possess voting rights.\n\n●Regional Head is responsible for promotion from Trainee to Regional accreditation, according to the committee’s accreditation regulation.",
