      "depth": 2,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "2.2.2",
      "title": "Council members",
      "body": "●Council Members are responsible for leading the Committees, organizing meetings, and overseeing the various projects essential to the committee’s work.\n\n●Council Members work closely with other Committee’s Members to ensure that committee decisions and actions are in line with established goals and guidelines.\n\n●Council Members are elected by Committee Members assembled in General Meetings.\n\n●Council Members serve two-year terms, and only members with International accreditations can be elected as Council members.\n\n●Each Council Member possesses one vote with a weight of two for decision-making.",
