      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "2.2.3",
      "title": "Conference Head and Deputy Head",
      "body": "●They are, esteemed for their extensive experience within the Committees, play a vital role in guiding the Council by overseeing other Committee’s Members, facilitating their growth, and actively participating in projects led by the Council.\n\n●Promotion to Conference Head / Deputy Head is determined through a vote by the Council, considering factors such as experience, knowledge, and contributions to the Committees.\n\n●Each Conference Head / Deputy Head possesses one vote with a weight of two in decision-making during General Meetings.",
