      "number": "2.2.4",
      "title": "Regional Head",
      "body": "●Regional Head are experienced members of the Committees who actively participate in discussions and hold voting privileges.\n\n●Regional Head selection is determined through a vote by their Conference Head, considering factors such as experience, knowledge, and contributions to the Committee.\n\n●Regional Head possesses one vote with a weight of two in decision-making during meetings.",
